  "name" : "Lipniacki2004 - Mathematical model of NFKB regulatory module",
  "description" : "<notes xmlns=\"http://www.sbml.org/sbml/level2/version4\">      <body xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">        <pre>its a mathematical model studying impact of TNF on NFKB nuclear dynamics. This model is derived from Hoffmann2002 (PMID:12424381).</pre>      </body>    </notes>",
